message: "Cite this software and the accompanying paper."
title: "Nested CSEOF operator as distributed"
authors:
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Sung Yong
    affiliation: "Korea Advanced Institute of Science and Technology"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/syongkim/nested-cseof"
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX   # version DOI of the first Zenodo harvest
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of the nested cyclostationary EOF operator recorded
  in Kim (J. Atmos. Oceanic Technol., submitted). Reproduces the synthetic
  Table 1 and figures of that manuscript. Not the FORTRAN or MATLAB originals,
  and not eigenanalysis of a cyclostationary covariance.
keywords:
  - cyclostationary EOF
  - nested CSEOF
  - demodulation
